Subject: [PATCH 26/26] Tune wave32 CKTile INT8 A8W8

- Add six candidates and a serial tuner.
- Select validated gfx1201 kernels by shape.
- Skip zero-width padding for exact tiles.

Tools used:
- Cursor: GPT-5.6 Sol

